  "description": "POLIMI Graduate School of Management is the Business School  of the Politecnico di Milano, one of the best scientific and technological universities in the world, which, for more than 40 years, has been engaged in providing management training programmes for graduates, professionals, companies, institutions and public administrations. Founded in 1979 as a Consortium between the Politecnico di Milano and a number of important Italian institutions and companies, today POLIMI GSoM is a non-for-profit consortium limited company. The school works every day to maximise its positive impact on society, exploiting and spreading the power of digital innovation, relationships and multiculturalism. Our portfolio of master programmes, focusing on specific areas of management, include Master courses targeting fresh graduates or graduates with limited working experience, and Executive Masters offered to managers and executives. The more specialized nature of a Master provides the candidate with the precise academic and theoretical framework to work in a specific management function.",
